{"step_index":1051,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T00:24:42Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-29T09:24:42+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-29T09:24:44+09:00\nThe search for \"\"라온엔터테인먼트\" \"매출액\"\" returned the following summary:\n(주)라온엔터테인먼트의 최신 재무 정보에 따르면, 2025년 기준 매출액은 **277억 6,127만 원**입니다[1][2].\n\n참고로, 동 기업의 주요 재무 지표는 다음과 같습니다:\n*   **영업이익:** 49억 5,000만 원[3][1]\n*   **당기순이익:** 41억 1,000만 원[3][1]\n\n라온엔터테인먼트는 2000년에 설립된 게임 개발 전문 기업으로, 대표작인 '테일즈런너' 등을 통해 성장해 왔습니다[4].\n\nSources:\n[1] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH47PYhVVdUL3hPfis32pJaC3qCAr9EczxPCf4gF5jbimNtAQm90Ugp7iiZ2fYi7TRwqaA0qFmxyYbcpvNi7VuM0ZtbGRDnL-j0xfAwUxDVpCH8vSVZK3hku_8i8SKWGhCcH0vSkI3rtpbwaVYFOjvALb4tudSBuYhAlsFQk0g-LDlMWVbE9S3IkWtik_Fo6vuRf5ptIXfgbrFA7e-6afMN-9Bq262f0fXb0ejhQNIwIDq7agHJKWASwnhZenr7hXSl03BOg-0HHtW5ijGcryMkrQfDbTpDjshDG8Y2eBYwstWAMKKtWLcVbWqP-BcxkT0y9GBTjOMwfHBdMWw=)\n[2] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHEwuRgdkmKtpu4vXKkjV6nCnlxXtACEXZlQK1mmJNRrmu2jxUiIIarMoMel4LARe1Y-fEg5XCiRYJcINFIAVy1FuvhmGajTwehRmher8mv1dowX90RDKW3TB00nZ8VB-0Axd-4bCwUL4Ea5V3uZYaacE0ptAthuOiOzoZx4NlBtK2LJYtHZDFueMyCwO7v-u_uKpvyK4gKKQ2U-ECh1PEEkZpziEC1n8LiQWRJGkoSbkaknYFH5NbrYBWch6_-QKJyzlYqv2DQijXwc_WpEYAgqm_wr0wyNT4Bsm0acb5otK5qGrk6VHkCLMtL7M2_)\n[3] [jobkorea.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE4atBrCGCGY0V06qFXMGlS1Eem39skm0LbGMyxs9haRAr4rvSQIe4-yABZ4m3qXAIjeYtI522LuN20cFMw9r7v5zr6lI-Lvby9jtGQN22x89gb2nN_QIxBWoZuoK03Wg==)\n[4] [catch.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFe6ruXVhRhkZuW4zdOePFQtgjelIU_ZnG0eruhpnqdXSjUDBm37TQuQHVnXaGHcHpOjxNX2ImHt-bZR47a-soBdIDbdzKXr6SM_SvVlnqZPd2j90A-vn1oowvvH6lzxC9unXc3Gg==)"}
